usage: plan.py commits [-h] [--plans-root PLANS_ROOT]
                       [--role {executor,reviewer,fix}] [--json]
                       plan [ref]

read commits linked to a plan by Plan trailers (JSON envelope)

positional arguments:
  plan                  plan id, PLAN<N> or path
  ref                   local Pn.m or Pn.m/U# (an item includes its units)

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --plans-root PLANS_ROOT
                        plans/ directory (default: nearest up from cwd)
  --role {executor,reviewer,fix}
  --json                accepted for symmetry; output is always JSON
